{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2019-10-20 22:30:00', 'title': "THE AUSTRALIAN RED CROSS BLOOD SERVICE SELECTS ABBOTT'S ALINITY SOLUTION FOR BLOOD AND PLASMA SCREENING", 'text': "ABBOTT ANNOUNCED THE AUSTRALIAN RED CROSS,BLOOD SERVICE (AUSTRALIAN BLOOD SERVICE) HAS SIGNED A MULTIPLE-YEAR AGREEMENT FOR ABBOTT'S MOST ADVANCED BLOOD AND PLASMA SCREENING TECHNOLOGY, ALINITY SYSTEM.  THE AUSTRALIAN BLOOD SERVICE COLLECTS 1.5 MILLION DONATIONS,EACH YEAR, PROVIDING A SAFE BLOOD SUPPLY TO 25 MILLION AUSTRALIANS. THE AGREEMENT ALSO INCLUDES ABBOTT'S TOTAL LAB AUTOMATION SOLUTION, AS WELL AS ITS INFORMATICS AND PROFESSIONAL SERVICES. THE AUSTRALIAN BLOOD SERVICE STAFF WILL USE ALINIQ AMS (ANALYZER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM), A PRODUCT OF ALINIQ PROFESSIONAL SERVICES, TO INTEGRATE DATA FROM MULTIPLE ANALYZERS SO STAFF CAN VIEW IT IN ONE PLACE, PROVIDING GREATER WORKFLOW EFFICIENCY AND BETTER QUALITY CONTROL. THE ALINITY S SYSTEM WILL HELP CONTINUOUSLY PROCESS UP TO 600 TESTS PER HOUR, WHILE THE LAB AUTOMATION SOLUTION WILL MANAGE ROUTINE, MANUAL TASKS SO STAFF CAN HANDLE UP TO 3,600 SAMPLES PER HOUR."}{'symbol': 'ABT', 'date': '2019-10-20 22:30:00', 'title': "THE AUSTRALIAN RED CROSS BLOOD SERVICE SELECTS ABBOTT'S ALINITY SOLUTION FOR BLOOD AND PLASMA SCREENING", 'text': "ABBOTT ANNOUNCED THE AUSTRALIAN RED CROSS,BLOOD SERVICE (AUSTRALIAN BLOOD SERVICE) HAS SIGNED A MULTIPLE-YEAR AGREEMENT FOR ABBOTT'S MOST ADVANCED BLOOD AND PLASMA SCREENING TECHNOLOGY, ALINITY SYSTEM.  THE AUSTRALIAN BLOOD SERVICE COLLECTS 1.5 MILLION DONATIONS,EACH YEAR, PROVIDING A SAFE BLOOD SUPPLY TO 25 MILLION AUSTRALIANS. THE AGREEMENT ALSO INCLUDES ABBOTT'S TOTAL LAB AUTOMATION SOLUTION, AS WELL AS ITS INFORMATICS AND PROFESSIONAL SERVICES. THE AUSTRALIAN BLOOD SERVICE STAFF WILL USE ALINIQ AMS (ANALYZER MANAGEMENT SYSTEM), A PRODUCT OF ALINIQ PROFESSIONAL SERVICES, TO INTEGRATE DATA FROM MULTIPLE ANALYZERS SO STAFF CAN VIEW IT IN ONE PLACE, PROVIDING GREATER WORKFLOW EFFICIENCY AND BETTER QUALITY CONTROL. THE ALI